---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import ScrollReveal from "../components/ScrollReveal.tsx";
import { SITE } from "../config/site.mjs";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout
  title={`About | ${SITE.title}`}
  description="About Tekromancy: Explorations into the arcane arts of Linux, Kubernetes, AI/ML systems, distributed networking, and cybersecurity."
  canonicalURL={`${SITE.url}/about`}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" role="main">
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
      <ScrollReveal client:idle>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono mb-4 border" style="background-color: var(--token-color-surface, #1e293b); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #334155); color: #22EE44;">
          <span style="color: #22EE44;">MANIFESTO &amp; IDENTITY</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-mono tracking-tight mb-4" style="color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827);">
          About Tekromancy
        </h1>
      </ScrollReveal>
      <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.1}>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--token-color-text-muted, #374151);">
          Demystifying the arcane arts of modern computing—from Linux kernel internals and distributed Kubernetes clusters to local neural intelligence and hardened cryptographic networks.
        </p>
      </ScrollReveal>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.2}>
          <h2>The Philosophy of Technomancy</h2>
          <p>
            To the uninitiated, modern computing infrastructure often resembles magic: invisible packets traveling trans-oceanic fiber cables in milliseconds, neural networks producing synthetic cognition from matrix multiplications, and distributed consensus algorithms orchestrating millions of containers across disparate clouds.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Tekromancy</strong> exists to peel back the layers of abstraction. We believe that true technical mastery comes from understanding systems down to the metal—how system calls transition across user space and kernel space, how eBPF programs monitor execution at CPU tick resolution, and how network packets traverse the Linux TCP/IP stack.
          </p>
        </ScrollReveal>

        <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.3}>
          <h2>Core Tenets</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Sovereignty &amp; Self-Reliance</strong>: Prioritize open-weight models, self-hosted infrastructure, and reproducible deployments over opaque proprietary SaaS lock-in.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Zero-Trust by Default</strong>: Security is not a perimeter wall; it is mutual authentication, in-kernel packet filtering, and continuous least-privilege verification.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Pragmatic Engineering</strong>: Theory without production operational discipline is useless. We focus on real-world configurations, benchmark data, and battle-tested architectures.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Unapologetically Technical</strong>: No generic buzzword summaries or shallow overview articles. We dive directly into configuration files, syscalls, kernel parameters, and executable code.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </ScrollReveal>

        <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.4}>
          <h2>Domains Explored</h2>
          <div class="not-prose grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-8">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border" style="background-color: var(--token-color-surface, #f8fafc); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #e2e8f0);">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono mb-2 flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827);">
                <Icon name="tabler:terminal-2" class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9);" />
                <span>Linux &amp; Kernel</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--token-color-text-muted, #64748b);">
                eBPF tracing, memory allocators, scheduler tuning, systemd architecture, and custom kernel configurations.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border" style="background-color: var(--token-color-surface, #f8fafc); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #e2e8f0);">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono mb-2 flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827);">
                <Icon name="tabler:topology-star-3" class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9);" />
                <span>Kubernetes &amp; Cloud</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--token-color-text-muted, #64748b);">
                Bare-metal clusters, Cilium CNI, GitOps with ArgoCD, custom controllers, and resilient distributed state.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border" style="background-color: var(--token-color-surface, #f8fafc); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #e2e8f0);">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono mb-2 flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827);">
                <Icon name="tabler:brain" class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9);" />
                <span>AI / ML Systems</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--token-color-text-muted, #64748b);">
                High-throughput inference with vLLM, PagedAttention, quantization, local agent orchestration, and GPU clustering.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border" style="background-color: var(--token-color-surface, #f8fafc); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #e2e8f0);">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono mb-2 flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827);">
                <Icon name="tabler:shield-lock" class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9);" />
                <span>SecOps &amp; Networking</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--token-color-text-muted, #64748b);">
                WireGuard mesh topologies, BGP routing, nftables, AppArmor enforcement, and zero-day threat mitigation.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </ScrollReveal>

        <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.5}>
          <h2>Author</h2>
          <div class="not-prose p-6 rounded-xl border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 my-6" style="background-color: var(--token-color-background, #ffffff); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #e2e8f0);">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-2xl shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9); color: var(--token-color-primary-foreground, #ffffff);">
              JC
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-mono mb-1" style="color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827);">
                Joshua Edward McLaughlin Cox
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-mono mb-3" style="color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9);">
                Technomancer &amp; Systems Architect
              </p>
              <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--token-color-text-muted, #64748b);">
                Passionate about low-level Linux systems engineering, high-scale Kubernetes deployments, local artificial intelligence pipelines, and defensive security. Building robust, sovereign computing environments that stand the test of time.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </ScrollReveal>

        <ScrollReveal client:load delay={0.6}>
          <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a
              href="/blog"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium font-mono text-sm shadow-sm"
              style="background-color: var(--token-color-primary, #0ea5e9); color: var(--token-color-primary-foreground, #ffffff);"
            >
              <Icon name="tabler:terminal" class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span>Read Technical Articles</span>
            </a>
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium font-mono text-sm border"
              style="background-color: var(--token-color-background, #ffffff); color: var(--token-color-text-primary, #111827); border-color: var(--token-color-border, #e2e8f0);"
            >
              <Icon name="tabler:mail" class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span>Initiate Contact</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </ScrollReveal>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
